WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.932
Here we wrap a simple classification rule inside a function.

00:00:03.932 --> 00:00:06.467
Check_fever receives a temperature.

00:00:06.467 --> 00:00:14.237
If the value is above ninety-eight point six, the function returns “Fever”; otherwise it returns “Normal.”

00:00:14.237 --> 00:00:18.203
The loop then reuses that same rule for several values.

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:22.212
The important programming idea is reusability.

00:00:22.212 --> 00:00:26.212
One rule can be applied repeatedly across a dataset.

00:00:26.212 --> 00:00:30.086
This is only a coding example, not medical guidance.
